---
import type { Lang } from '../../i18n/ui';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CtaBlock from '../CtaBlock.astro';

interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
---

<Layout
  title={lang === 'en' ? 'Contact | Bloss0m' : '聯絡 | Bloss0m'}
  description={
    lang === 'en'
      ? 'About and contact for AI Platform & Agentic AI Engineer. RAG, Multi-Agent, Realtime AI, enterprise adoption.'
      : '關於與聯絡：AI 平台與 Agentic AI 工程師。RAG、多代理、即時 AI、企業落地。'
  }
  lang={lang}
>
  {lang === 'en' ? (
    <div class="content-region">
      <header class="page-header">
        <div class="page-header-inner">
          <img src="/bloom.webp" alt="" class="page-header-avatar" width="160" height="160" />
          <h1>About & Contact</h1>
          <h2>Justin</h2>
          <p>AI Platform & Agentic AI Engineer · RAG · Multi-Agent · Realtime AI</p>
          <p>poirotw66@gmail.com</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="section-spacer inner-page-sections">
        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>Profile</h2>
          <p>Engineer focused on AI applications and technical innovation, with a solid background in machine learning and deep learning. I specialize in turning cutting-edge technology into deployable, scalable systems.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>Cathay Financial Holdings (OCR & Document Intelligence)</h2>
          <p>At Cathay, I led the build of a medical receipt OCR system: data preprocessing, Traditional Chinese PaddleOCR training and optimization, and table/text parsing. The system improved recognition accuracy and throughput and established a scalable intelligent document processing architecture.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>Recent Focus (LLM, Agent, RAG, AIGC)</h2>
          <p>I now focus on LLM applications and AI IDE–driven development, with an emphasis on speed and security. Highlights include:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Introducing <strong>LLM as a Judge</strong> on a feedback platform to turn qualitative feedback into quantitative scores</li>
            <li>Building an <strong>Agentic RAG</strong> architecture for the <strong>M365 knowledge assistant</strong> to support real-time customer support and knowledge retrieval</li>
            <li>Building a conference news and trend summarization tool</li>
            <li>Implementing a digital human video application to extend <strong>AIGC</strong> use cases</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>Current Research (Agent, MCP, Enterprise Architecture)</h2>
          <p>I am deepening work on <strong>AI Agent</strong> design and <strong>Model Context Protocol (MCP)</strong>—multi-agent coordination, tool orchestration, and safety boundaries—and aim to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Refactor development workflows with <strong>AI IDE</strong></li>
            <li>Balance security and system stability with fast iteration</li>
            <li>Establish sustainable <strong>enterprise-grade AI architecture</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>Value Proposition</h2>
          <p>I believe the value of AI lies not only in model capability but in how we integrate technology, process, and safety with an engineering mindset to deliver efficient, scalable intelligent applications.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>Open to discussions on AI platform, Agent, RAG, or Realtime AI—consulting, development, or full-time roles.</p>
          <div class="about-contact-links">
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wei-cyun-chang-23a882219/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/poirotw66" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <CtaBlock
        text="Looking for an AI platform or Agentic AI partner? Let's take GenAI from PoC to production."
        buttonText="Contact on LinkedIn"
        buttonHref="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wei-cyun-chang-23a882219/"
        buttonTarget="_blank"
        buttonRel="noopener"
      />
    </div>
  ) : (
    <div class="content-region">
      <header class="page-header">
        <div class="page-header-inner">
          <img src="/bloom.webp" alt="" class="page-header-avatar" width="160" height="160" />
          <h1>關於與聯絡</h1>
          <h2>Justin</h2>
          <p>AI 平台與 Agentic AI 工程師 · RAG · 多代理 · 即時 AI</p>
          <p>poirotw66@gmail.com</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="section-spacer inner-page-sections">
        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>簡介</h2>
          <p>專注於企業級 AI 應用落地的 AI 平台與 Agentic AI 工程師，擅長將 GenAI 原型推進為可交付、可維運、可擴展的產品與平台。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>國泰金控時期（OCR 與文件智能）</h2>
          <p>我的實務經驗涵蓋 OCR 文件智能、LLM 評估、Agentic RAG、語音互動、AIGC 內容生成與企業 API 整合。曾於國泰金控主導醫療收據 OCR 系統建置，負責資料前處理、繁體中文 PaddleOCR 模型優化、表格解析與多版型文件處理流程，提升複雜醫療單據的欄位辨識穩定性與處理效率。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>近年重心（LLM、Agent、RAG、AIGC）</h2>
          <p>近年我聚焦 LLM 應用架構、AI Agent 與 MCP，實作包含 LLM as a Judge、M365 知識助手、Agentic RAG、新聞趨勢整理與數字人影片生成等應用。</p>
          <ul>
            <li>於回饋平台導入 <strong>LLM as a Judge</strong>，將質化回饋轉化為量化評分</li>
            <li>於 <strong>M365 知識助手</strong>建構 <strong>Agentic RAG</strong> 架構，支援業務即時客服與知識檢索</li>
            <li>打造研討會新聞趨勢整理工具</li>
            <li>實踐數字人影片製作應用，拓展 <strong>AIGC</strong> 落地場景</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>當前研究方向（Agent、MCP、企業架構）</h2>
          <p>目前深入研究 <strong>AI Agent</strong> 架構與 <strong>Model Context Protocol（MCP）</strong>，探索多代理協作、工具調度與安全邊界設計，致力於：</p>
          <ul>
            <li>以 <strong>AI IDE</strong> 重構開發流程</li>
            <li>在高速迭代中兼顧資安與系統穩定性</li>
            <li>建立可持續演進的<strong>企業級 AI 架構</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>價值主張</h2>
          <p>我重視的不只是模型能力，也包含可靠性、安全性、效能、監控與交付品質，目標是把 AI 從 demo 推進到團隊真正能用、能維運、能擴展的系統。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block">
          <h2>聯絡方式</h2>
          <p>歡迎洽談 AI 平台、Agent、RAG、Realtime AI 相關的顧問或開發合作、以及求職機會。</p>
          <div class="about-contact-links">
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wei-cyun-chang-23a882219/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/poirotw66" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <CtaBlock
        text="正在尋找 AI 平台或 Agent 落地夥伴？一起把 GenAI 從 PoC 做到上線。"
        buttonText="LinkedIn 聯絡"
        buttonHref="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wei-cyun-chang-23a882219/"
        buttonTarget="_blank"
        buttonRel="noopener"
      />
    </div>
  )}
</Layout>
